&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;$10,000 Sign-On Bonus for Full-Time!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is seeking a compassionate and dedicated &lt;strong&gt;Occupational Therapist (OT)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Hudson County Visits team. This position offers the flexibility of &lt;strong&gt;full-time or part-time&lt;/strong&gt; employment while providing one-on-one care to &lt;strong&gt;adult and geriatric clients&lt;/strong&gt; in the comfort of their homes throughout &lt;strong&gt;Hudson County.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As a Home Health Occupational Therapist, you will be part of a multidisciplinary team committed to helping clients maintain independence, safety, and quality of life while receiving care where they are most comfortable—at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Home Health?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible scheduling and autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One-on-one patient care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in small territories throughout Hudson County&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningful relationships with patients and families&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduced time in facilities and more time making an impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation and mileage reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform home visits within designated geographic territories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete comprehensive evaluations of patients&#39; functional abilities, including ADLs, IADLs, mobility, cognition, communication, and safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop individualized treatment plans designed to maximize independence and functional outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess home environments and recommend adaptive equipment and modifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with nursing and other disciplines to develop and implement patient-centered care plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate patients, caregivers, and family members on therapeutic interventions and strategies to improve safety and independence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately document patient assessments, interventions, and outcomes using electronic medical records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current New Jersey Occupational Therapist license.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of one year of recent experience as an Occupational Therapist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate of an accredited Occupational Therapy program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior home health experience preferred but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong clinical, organizational, communication, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and manage time effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with EMR documentation preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Base Pay, depending upon qualifications and subject to negotiation:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;$75.00 - $80.00 per point ($117,000-$124,800 annual earning potential)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;$10,000 Sign-On Bonus for Full-Time OTs&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At BAYADA, we believe our employees are our greatest asset. We offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay and direct deposit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mileage reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career advancement opportunities and clinical career paths&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship and continuing education opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One-on-one training and support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Referral bonus programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognition programs that celebrate excellence, compassion, and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join a company that is committed to helping people have a safe home life with comfort, independence, and dignity.&lt;/p&gt;
